        "original_id": "59a9c466-e511-5edd-b2be-05cccb414a55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Todd Fancey\n- Organizations: OK Go, The New Pornographers, Limblifter\n- Places: Chicago, Illinois; Los Angeles, California; Vancouver, British Columbia\n- Products: \"Needing/Getting\", \"Of the Blue Colour of the Sky\"\n- Topics: rock bands, indie rock bands\n\nFacts:\n- The New Pornographers is a Canadian indie rock band formed in 1997 in Vancouver, British Columbia.\n- OK Go is an American rock band originally from Chicago, Illinois, and is now based in Los Angeles, California.\n- \"Needing/Getting\" is a song by OK Go from the band's 2010 album \"Of the Blue Colour of the Sky\".\n- Todd Fancey is best known as the guitarist for the Vancouver-based indie rock band The New Pornographers and the bassist for Limblifter.",
